# an upgrade (1.3.0): a piece never changed takes today's recipe; one you changed keeps your settings.
# tests/host/proj-1.2.0*.bin are 1.2.0's own saves (made by its project code: every piece its 1.2.0 recipe; the second
# with Basic's Stabs set by hand to 77)
storefile tests/host/proj-1.2.0.bin
reboot
wait 500
expect format 36
expect piece 0
# Basic as today has it (Stabs 3, a count since format 32: 1.2.0's 30; Feedback 62, 1.2.0's 60), its noise Vinyl
expect par28 3
expect par11 62
expect par4 30
turn PRESET 3
wait 300
expect piece 3
# Fog too (its chord 50, its kick's Density 75)
expect par0 50
expect par116 75
turn PRESET -3
storefile tests/host/proj-1.2.0-basic-changed.bin
reboot
wait 500
